      "content": "that makes sense. can u go a bit deeper into how they describe the actual impact of these changes? like, when they talk about society \"deviating\" from divine law, do they use specific terms to describe what happens to the community or the family unit when these traditional structures are lost? i need to capture the intensity of their critique for my paper.",
